<figure class="order-contract-diagram" aria-labelledby="order-contract-caption">
  <svg
    class="order-contract-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 600"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="order-contract-title order-contract-desc"
  >
    <title id="order-contract-title">先定義承諾，再選擇最小交易邊界</title>
    <desc id="order-contract-desc"
      >入口量測每次合格 HTTP 嘗試，模組化應用在同一筆 MySQL
      交易中保存冪等結果、訂單與庫存預留，提交後才回覆成立。回覆遺失時，用原操作鍵查詢或重試。</desc
    >
    <rect
      class="order-contract-diagram__banner"
      x="20"
      y="20"
      width="920"
      height="76"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__title" x="44" y="52"
      >成功回覆的承諾：一張訂單，一次庫存預留</text
    >
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__detail" x="44" y="77"
      >首版同步方案；單一應用中的模組共用本地交易</text
    >
    <rect
      class="order-contract-diagram__card"
      x="20"
      y="124"
      width="920"
      height="100"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__title" x="44" y="158"
      >01 入口：留下每一次嘗試</text
    >
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__detail" x="44" y="190"
      >attempt ID、開始時間、操作鍵摘要；故障與逾時也進分母</text
    >
    <path
      class="order-contract-diagram__arrow"
      d="M480 230 V248 m-6 -6 6 6 6 -6"></path>
    <rect
      class="order-contract-diagram__card"
      x="20"
      y="256"
      width="920"
      height="128"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__title" x="44" y="290"
      >02 應用 + MySQL：一起提交</text
    >
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__detail" x="44" y="322"
      >冪等唯一約束 · 訂單與價格快照 · 有條件的庫存預留</text
    >
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__detail" x="44" y="352"
      >不變量由約束與整合驗收守住；不能用錯誤預算抵銷</text
    >
    <path
      class="order-contract-diagram__arrow"
      d="M480 390 V408 m-6 -6 6 6 6 -6"></path>
    <rect
      class="order-contract-diagram__card"
      x="20"
      y="416"
      width="920"
      height="100"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__title" x="44" y="450"
      >03 提交後回覆；詳情讀主庫</text
    >
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__detail" x="44" y="482"
      >回覆遺失：結果待確認，以同一操作鍵找回原單</text
    >
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__detail" x="44" y="558"
      >量測邊界：入口收完請求 → 送完符合契約的終局回覆</text
    >
  </svg>
  <svg
    class="order-contract-diagram__mobile"
    viewBox="0 0 280 666"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="order-contract-mobile-title order-contract-mobile-desc"
  >
    <title id="order-contract-mobile-title">訂單承諾與交易邊界：手機版</title>
    <desc id="order-contract-mobile-desc"
      >桌面圖的直向排列：入口記錄、同一交易提交、回覆與原鍵查詢。每次嘗試都保留，不把逾時排除。</desc
    >
    <rect
      class="order-contract-diagram__banner"
      x="4"
      y="8"
      width="272"
      height="86"
      rx="10"></rect>
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__title" x="20" y="38"
      >成功回覆的承諾</text
    >
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__detail" x="20" y="68"
      >一張訂單，一次庫存預留</text
    >
    <rect
      class="order-contract-diagram__card"
      x="4"
      y="120"
      width="272"
      height="120"
      rx="10"></rect>
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__title" x="20" y="150"
      >01 入口留下嘗試</text
    >
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__detail" x="20" y="180"
      >ID、時間、操作鍵摘要</text
    >
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__detail" x="20" y="210"
      >故障與逾時也進分母</text
    >
    <path
      class="order-contract-diagram__arrow"
      d="M140 246 V266 m-6 -6 6 6 6 -6"></path>
    <rect
      class="order-contract-diagram__card"
      x="4"
      y="274"
      width="272"
      height="150"
      rx="10"></rect>
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__title" x="20" y="304"
      >02 同一筆交易</text
    >
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__detail" x="20" y="334"
      >冪等唯一約束、訂單快照</text
    >
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__detail" x="20" y="364"
      >有條件的庫存預留</text
    >
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__detail" x="20" y="394"
      >錯誤預算不能抵銷錯單</text
    >
    <path
      class="order-contract-diagram__arrow"
      d="M140 430 V450 m-6 -6 6 6 6 -6"></path>
    <rect
      class="order-contract-diagram__card"
      x="4"
      y="458"
      width="272"
      height="120"
      rx="10"></rect>
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__title" x="20" y="488"
      >03 提交後回覆</text
    >
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__detail" x="20" y="518"
      >詳情讀主庫；回覆遺失時</text
    >
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__detail" x="20" y="548"
      >用原操作鍵查詢或重試</text
    >
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__detail" x="20" y="612"
      >量測：入口收完請求</text
    >
    <text class="order-contract-diagram__detail" x="20" y="640"
      >到送完契約終局回覆</text
    >
  </svg>
  <figcaption id="order-contract-caption">
    教學方案：模組邊界保留，首版把必須一起成立的資料放在同一個 MySQL 交易邊界。
  </figcaption>
</figure>
